**Adjusting terminal polling on fetch error**

Noticed that polling starts even if fetching terminal status fails and disables controls; I'll update the flow to prevent starting polling after an error disables the terminal.
thinking
**Modifying terminal status fetch to control polling**

Planning to have `fetchTerminalStatus` return a success boolean and update `openTerminalSession` to start polling only if status fetch succeeds and terminal is running, preventing unwanted polling after errors.
